{"strongs": "H1952", "word": "הוֺן", "translit": "hon", "root": "הון", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "wealth, sufficiency", "definition": "הוֺן noun masculine Prov 8:18 , wealth, sufficiency (in poetry, almost wholly Wisdom Literature, especially Proverbs; compare I. אוֺן above) — absolute הוֺן Prov 1:13 + 15 t. + Ezek 27:12 ; Ezek 27:18 (where ᵐ5 ᵑ6 Co הוֺנֵךְ ); construct Prov 6:31 + 3 t.; suffix הוֺנָ֑ךָ Prov 3:9 הוֺנֵךְ Ezek 27:27 + v Ezek 27:12 v Ezek 27:18 Co ; הוֺנוֺ Prov 28:8 plural suffix הוֺנַיִךְ Ezek 27:33 — \\ \\ l. wealth Ps 112:3 (|| עשֶׁר ) Prov 8:18 (|| id. ) Prov 1:13 (|| שָׁלָל ) compare הוֺן עָשִׁיר Prov 10:15 (opposed to דַּלִּים ), Prov 18:11 ; Prov 3:9 (|| רֵאשִׁית כָּלתְּֿבוּאָתָ֑ךָ ) הוֺן בֵּיתוֺ Prov 6:31 ; Song 8:7 בַּיִת וָהוֺן Prov 19:14 see Prov 19:4 (opposed to דָּל ) Prov 28:8 (opposed to דַּלִּים ); also Ps 119:14 ; Prov 11:4 ; Prov 12:27 ; Prov 13:7 ; Prov 13:11 ; Prov 24:4 ; Prov 28:22 (opposed to חֶסֶר ) Prov 29:3 ; Ezek 27:12 ; Ezek 27:18 ; Ezek 27:27 ; Ezek 27:33 . 2. with מָכַר + בְּ pretii, = high value , or price תִּעמכֹּר עַמְּךָ בְּלֹא הוֺן Ps 44:13 — i.e. cheaply, = 'for no price at all' (|| מחיר ). 3. sufficiency, enough! in exclamation Prov 30:15 ; Prov 30:16 (so also ᵐ5 ᵑ7 , Aq Symm Theod ἁρκεῖ ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2138')\">BDB2138</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1952')\">H1952</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2137')\">BDB2137</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2139')\">BDB2139</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Prov 8:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,18)\">Prov 8:18</ref></sup>, <highlightword>wealth, sufficiency</highlightword> (in poetry, almost wholly Wisdom Literature, especially Proverbs; compare I. <bdbheb>אוֺן</bdbheb> above) — absolute <bdbheb>הוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 1:13\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\"